Approach-1
str.chars()
   .mapToObj(n -> (char) n)          //.mapToObj(n -> String.valueOf((char) n))
   .collect(Collectors.joining());

Approach-2
Arrays.stream(str.split(""))
      .collect(Collectors.joining());

